---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../utils/url';
---

<BaseLayout slug="contatti" title="DOVE SIAMO">
	<iframe class="u-border-0 u-block" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d145.3786663682362!2d13.245138779323867!3d46.03847811126671!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x477a4aaec35168db%3A0x893b4a287ca799ba!2sDeep%20Diving%20Udine.%20Corsi%20sub%20a%20Udine%2C%20Friuli.%20Brevetti%20internazionali.!5e1!3m2!1sit!2sit!4v1735028315327!5m2!1sit!2sit" width="100%" height="250" title="mappa Google di Deep Diving Udine" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>

	<div class="wsite-spacer u-h-50"></div>

	<h2>CHAT</h2>
	<hr />

	<div class="columns cols-2 u-center">
		<a href='https://wa.me/393701359305' target='_blank'>
			<img class="u-max-w-100" src={withBase('/uploads/whatsapp-chat_orig.webp')} alt="Chat on Whatsapp" />
		</a>
		<a href='http://m.me/718553978234530'>
			<img class="u-max-w-100" src={withBase('/uploads/chat-messenger_orig.webp')} alt="Chat on Messenger" />
		</a>
	</div>

	<h2>CONTATTACI</h2>
	<hr />

	<div class="columns cols-2">
		<form enctype="multipart/form-data" action="https://www.weebly.com/weebly/apps/formSubmit.php" method="POST">
			<div class="wsite-form-label wsite-form-fields-required-label"><span class="form-required">*</span> Indica un campo obbligatorio</div>

			<div class="wsite-form-field">
				<div class="wsite-form-label">Nome e cognome <span class="form-required">*</span></div>
				<div class="form-row">
					<div class="wsite-form-input-container">
						<input aria-required="true" aria-label="Nome" class="wsite-form-input wsite-input" placeholder="Nome" type="text" name="_u866342611807326161[first]" />
					</div>
					<div class="wsite-form-input-container">
						<input aria-required="true" aria-label="Cognome" class="wsite-form-input wsite-input" placeholder="Cognome" type="text" name="_u866342611807326161[last]" />
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="wsite-form-field">
				<label class="wsite-form-label" for="input-347385114401369784">E-mail <span class="form-required">*</span></label>
				<div class="wsite-form-input-container">
					<input aria-required="true" id="input-347385114401369784" class="wsite-form-input wsite-input" type="text" name="_u347385114401369784" />
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="wsite-form-field">
				<label class="wsite-form-label" for="input-444966157828232283">Le tue domande <span class="form-required">*</span></label>
				<div class="wsite-form-input-container">
					<textarea aria-required="true" id="input-444966157828232283" class="wsite-form-input wsite-input u-h-50" name="_u444966157828232283"></textarea>
				</div>
			</div>

			<input type="hidden" name="wsite_subject" />
			<input type="hidden" name="form_version" value="2" />
			<input type="hidden" name="wsite_approved" value="approved" />
			<input type="hidden" name="ucfid" value="570501092295231274" />
			<div class="form-actions">
				<input class="wsite-button" type="submit" value="INVIA RICHIESTA" />
			</div>
		</form>

		<div>
			<p>Cercheremo di rispondere nel pi&ugrave; breve tempo possibile (se non avete accettato i cookies il modulo potrebbe non funzionare).<br />Controllate anche la casella "spam" (i filtri non sono sempre intelligenti...).</p>

			<p>E-mail <a href="mailto:deepdivingudine@gmail.com">deepdivingudine@gmail.com</a></p>

			<p>Tel. +39 370 1359305</p>

			<p><strong>N.B.: a causa delle innumerevoli telefonate pubblicitarie, preferibilmente scriveteci una mail all'indirizzo sopra riportato.</strong></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
